menu "SiGGECA remote node configuration"

    config SIGGECA_REMOTE_WAKE_INTERVAL_SEC
        int "Wake / acquire interval (seconds)"
        default 3600
        help
            How often the remote node wakes up to read the Campbell
            datalogger and transmit over LoRa. Proposal CAV 2026/2027
            sizes the energy budget around a 5 min-per-hour duty cycle
            (sec. 6.4) -- keep this in sync with that analysis if changed.

endmenu
